                    {
                        "form_id": "e9831793-8aef-481e-ba58-2f0e969034ac",
                        "entry_id": "509646d3-579f-36b5-a78f-1ec6ec2c1287",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "декабри́стах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e76cbc3f-f172-3cc8-8a57-85bae6a17d87",
                        "entry_id": "509646d3-579f-36b5-a78f-1ec6ec2c1287",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. участник дворянского революционного движения в России, различных тайных обществ второй половины 1810-х — первой половины 1820-х, организовавших антиправительственное восстание 14 (26) декабря 1825 года"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f45941c0-be1e-4db8-bb6a-26139244d201",
                                "sense_id": "e76cbc3f-f172-3cc8-8a57-85bae6a17d87",
                                "text": "После декабристов все попытки основывать общества не удавались действительно; бедность сил, неясность целей указывали на необходимость другой работы ― предварительно, внутренней."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "923ea091-d187-429a-ada0-03534560a00a",
                                "sense_id": "e76cbc3f-f172-3cc8-8a57-85bae6a17d87",
                                "text": "Восстание декабристов не нашло в нём никакого положительного отклика."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bcdcfc1-7946-474d-8596-6ccbc75910cb",
                                "sense_id": "e76cbc3f-f172-3cc8-8a57-85bae6a17d87",
                                "text": "Особый след в жизни Сибири оставили декабристы и последующие ссыльные, которые очень много дали в развитии культуры, образования, науки, медицины, землепользования."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fe2eb532-24ad-45d8-a38d-a0ac64ca260f",
                        "source_entry_id": "509646d3-579f-36b5-a78f-1ec6ec2c1287",
                        "source_sense_id": "e76cbc3f-f172-3cc8-8a57-85bae6a17d87",
                        "target_lang_word": "Decembrist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Decembrist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c686ea22-c8e4-36b8-afec-951bcb29aec1",
                                        "entry_id": "51a95b3a-2231-341f-bd09-15a1ac75d637",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A participant in, or sympathizer with, the Decembrist revolt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dfc8e4a-2fb6-4124-81c4-4aa8a2c76321",
                                                "sense_id": "c686ea22-c8e4-36b8-afec-951bcb29aec1",
                                                "text": "Thus on the death of Alexander I in 1825 the succession of his brother Nicholas I was delayed and confused by doubts over the heir and was marked by the bloody mutinies of the Decembrists; Nicholas died during the Crimean War when a contemporary wrote that his only choice was between abdication and death; his son, Alexander II, was assassinated by terrorists a quarter of a century later."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d8f018e-a2bb-4b8d-8447-06dea3521522",
                                                "sense_id": "c686ea22-c8e4-36b8-afec-951bcb29aec1",
                                                "text": "2003, Catherine O'Neil, With Shakespeare's Eyes: Pushkin's Creative Appropriation of Shakespeare, University of Delaware Press, Associated University Presses, page 81,\nMany of the Decembrists listed Pushkin's poetry as a source for their \"free-thinking,\" and there were reports of frightened people (Pushkin himself was one of them) hastily burning unfinished poems that had circulated in manuscript."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb80a3d4-96ca-4eb9-8835-53721331c8bf",
                                                "sense_id": "c686ea22-c8e4-36b8-afec-951bcb29aec1",
                                                "text": "These liberal revolutionaries, who have gone down in history as the Decembrists, called on the army not to swear allegiance to Nicholas. The Decembrist-led rebels were surrounded by troops loyal to Nicholas on the banks of the Neva River in St. Petersburg."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Decembrist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a27b1e9-56f1-3f46-9328-c10e6e001399",
                                        "entry_id": "c4fffbd0-f5bb-373c-9059-95081158b2ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "According to or derived from the politics or philosophy of the Decembrists."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "787ba00e-c7a5-4023-abbb-a1c66edd91a5",
                                                "sense_id": "3a27b1e9-56f1-3f46-9328-c10e6e001399",
                                                "text": "The word civicism (grazhdanstvennost’) originated in the enlightenment ideal of civic Rome, perceptions of the poet as a patriotic citizen and son of the fatherland, and Decembrist dreams of a republic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8673f65-dae9-4884-94e7-17fff5b3fd7e",
                                                "sense_id": "3a27b1e9-56f1-3f46-9328-c10e6e001399",
                                                "text": "War and Peace grew out of Tolstoy's attempts to write a Decembrist novel, a work that first began to take shape in October 1856, when \"The Distant Field\" was begun."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c9dcb4d-2e3e-4626-ab7b-e791708fd5e9",
                                                "sense_id": "3a27b1e9-56f1-3f46-9328-c10e6e001399",
                                                "text": "Mariia Trubnikova was raised in an atmosphere of pious reverence for Decembrist ideals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
